<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JULY 22 - SUNNY, RAIN.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JULY 22 - SUNNY, RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunny with cloudy spells across the country with light winds from the west, rain expected later in the day, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 25 and 30 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 25 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
